## 2. Why Web Alarm Audio Alone Is Not Enough (The Browser Sandbox Problem)

| Clock Mechanism | Active Tab (Tab Open) | Inactive Tab (Tab Backgrounded) | Closed Tab / Locked Phone | Solution / Fallback |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **HTML5 Web Audio API Alarm** | ✅ **Plays Instant Audio Ringtone** | ⚠️ Muted by browser power-saving | ❌ Killed by OS process reaper | Pair with Layer 3 (iCal Sync & Twilio SMS) |
| **Frontend `setInterval` Ticker** | ✅ **Executes Every 1 Second** | ⚠️ Throttled to 1 min by browser | ❌ Stopped completely | Use Service Worker `sw.js` for Web Push |
| **Native iCal / Google Calendar** | ✅ **Fires Native Phone Alarm** | ✅ **Fires Native Phone Alarm** | ✅ **Fires Native Phone Alarm** | 1-Click `📅 Add to Calendar` Export |
| **Backend APScheduler Worker** | ✅ **Fires SMS / Push** | ✅ **Fires SMS / Push** | ✅ **Fires SMS / Push** | Python `APScheduler` polling DB |

